{"updated":"2026-09-14T13:28:58.989Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Why Saudi Arabia’s East-West pipeline matters for global oil. Elsewhere, French 2027 presidential elections: Why Gen Z has mobilised for Mélenchon. And should the brakes be put on AI?. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and Ukraine are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 0.9 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 2.3 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 0.4 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 37 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.6 near 78 km NNE of Tobelo, Indonesia. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.24,0.29,0.34,0.37,0.41,0.45,0.5,0.53,0.57,0.6,0.63,0.67,0.79,0.88,1.03,1.42,1.53,1.58,1.61,1.65,1.7,1.72,1.74,1.76,1.81,1.86,1.93,2,2.04,2.08,2.11,2.17,2.21,2.24,2.3,2.35,2.39,2.43,2.47,2.52,2.58,2.62,2.68,2.75,2.82,2.9,3.02,3.11,3.26,3.29,3.32,3.35,3.4,3.44,3.5,3.61,3.69,3.75,3.82,3.87,3.92,3.96,4.02,4.06,4.09,4.11,4.16,4.18,4.2,4.23,4.27,4.32,4.41,4.47,4.54,4.61,4.67,4.74,4.78,4.84,4.87,4.93,5.05,5.2,5.35,5.96,6.01,6.08,6.18,6.26,6.32,6.38,6.44,6.5,6.56,6.62,6.68,6.75,6.86,6.94,7.02,7.09,7.14,7.17,7.26,7.35,7.4,7.45,7.5,7.56,7.61,7.72,7.79,7.84,7.91,7.96,8.08,8.14,8.2,8.27,8.36,8.42,8.53,8.65,8.73,8.79,8.84,8.89,8.93,8.96,9.01,9.06,9.09,9.13,9.16,9.21,9.24,9.31,9.39,9.45,9.51,9.55,9.64,9.76,9.83,9.95,10.16,10.76,10.88,10.94,10.99,11.04,11.08,11.13,11.17,11.23,11.4,11.46,11.63,11.69,11.74,11.79,11.83,11.89,11.92,12.01,12.03,12.54,12.61,12.82,12.9,12.93,12.98,13.03,13.07,13.13,13.18,13.24,13.28,13.34,13.39,13.43,13.47,13.53,13.58,13.63,13.71,13.77,13.83,13.87,13.92,14,14.12,14.27,14.51,14.56,14.63,14.74,14.81,14.87,14.99,15.02,15.11,15.35,15.44,15.48,15.54,15.56,15.64,